<template><div><h1 id="wiki_key_features">Key Features</h1><section><h2 id="details-setup">Open Burger Town and locate decontamination</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-infection-exo" data-guide-step>Open the Sewers and take an Exo Suit. Open access to Atlas Command, Value Voltage and Burger Town and power equipment where needed. Locate the sewer decontamination pad before carrying infected quest items.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1717.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1717.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Exo Suit station in the Sewers&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Exo Suit station in the Sewers&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1717&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-infection-rounds" data-guide-step>Infection and survivor objectives are ordinary round events. Deal with their on-screen demands while following this quest; completing a survivor escort does not replace a burger step. Keep your decontamination route clear during infected rounds.</li></ol></section>
<h1 id="wiki_main_quest">Main Quest</h1><section><h2 id="details-pan">Find the pan and open the sewer chamber</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-infection-pan-pickup" data-guide-step>From spawn’s highest crate, Exo-boost toward the cracked roof and collect the golden frying pan.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1718.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1718.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Golden frying pan on the cracked spawn rooftop&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Golden frying pan on the cracked spawn rooftop&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1718&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-infection-valves" data-guide-step>Search the connected sewer pipes for four orange valves. Interact with each until steam vents. Their positions vary; inspect above and below the corridors and make another pass if a valve remains missing. After four successful interactions, the passage behind the waterfall opens.<p><a href="https://youtu.be/BBTSuV1gCxQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Video atlas of possible sewer-valve positions ↗</a></p><GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1719.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1719.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Orange sewer valve example on the connected pipes&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Orange sewer valve example on the connected pipes&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1719&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1720.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1720.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Opened passage behind the sewer waterfall&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Opened passage behind the sewer waterfall&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1720&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-infection-pan-altar" data-guide-step>Place the pan on the altar inside the hidden chamber. The altar lowers to begin charging.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1721.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1721.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Golden-pan altar inside the hidden chamber&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Golden-pan altar inside the hidden chamber&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1721&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-blood">Season the pan</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-infection-pan-blood" data-guide-step>Kill zombies in the LOWER part of the altar room until the pan fills and the altar rises. Kills upstairs do not satisfy the collection area. Retrieve the charged pan and place it on Burger Town’s kitchen stove.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1722.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1722.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Lower chamber area where kills charge the pan&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Lower chamber area where kills charge the pan&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1722&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1723.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1723.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Burger Town stove receiving the charged pan&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Burger Town stove receiving the charged pan&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1723&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-burger">Gather, cook and assemble the burger</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-infection-meat" data-guide-step>Find one meat piece in EACH of Atlas Command, Value Voltage, Sewers and Burger Town. Carry one piece at a time and deposit it on the pan before collecting another. Use the district atlas below; searched sites are candidates, not four simultaneous spawns.<p><a href="#details-meat-locations">Open the district meat-search atlas ↗</a></p><GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1724.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1724.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Small meat pickup: compare its shape while searching&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Small meat pickup: compare its shape while searching&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1724&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-infection-cook" data-guide-step>Obtain a Magnetron from the 3D Printer. Once all four pieces are on the stove, heat them with its beam until a ding plays and the meat becomes a cooked patty.</li>
<li id="guide-step-infection-bun" data-guide-step>Kill a Burger Town-uniform zombie and walk over its dropped bun. Interact with the cooked patty to add the bun, then pick up the assembled burger. Picking it up infects its carrier.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1761.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1761.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Bun dropped by a Burger Town-uniform zombie&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Bun dropped by a Burger Town-uniform zombie&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1761&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-cleanse">Cleanse the burger and feed Bubby</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-infection-cleanse-burger" data-guide-step>Go directly to the sewer decontamination pad, using the Burger Town chute if convenient. Cleanse yourself while carrying the burger, then return and feed it to Bubby. His low-battery response starts the next phase.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1762.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1762.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Bubby outside Burger Town&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Bubby outside Burger Town&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1762&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-battery">Charge Bubby’s battery</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-infection-battery-screen" data-guide-step>In Atlas Command, interact with the Bubby schematic screen inside one Command Center unit. Immediately run to the other unit containing the power generator and take the battery from its opened box. If it closes before pickup, activate the schematic again.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1763.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1763.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Bubby schematic screen&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Bubby schematic screen&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1763&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1766.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1766.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Timed battery box near the other Command Center power generator&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Timed battery box near the other Command Center power generator&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1766&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-infection-charge-battery" data-guide-step>Put the battery into the Value Voltage charger. Defend it from zombies; if they knock it out, pick it up and replace it. When fully charged it becomes red. Retrieve it and give it to Bubby.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1767.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1767.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Value Voltage battery charging station&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Value Voltage battery charging station&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1767&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-rocket">Authorize the Burger Town rocket</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-infection-key" data-guide-step>Take Bubby’s offered key. Climb the rooftop ladder, unlock the hatch in the giant burger and use its schematic screen. The Access Denied response tells you to obtain a fingerprint.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1768.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1768.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Locked hatch in the rooftop burger&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Locked hatch in the rooftop burger&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1768&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1769.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1769.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Authorization screen inside the giant burger&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Authorization screen inside the giant burger&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1769&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-infection-arm" data-guide-step>Activate the sewer Insta-Gator trap. When the gator emerges holding a zombie, shoot it rapidly until it breaks and drops the floating zombie arm. Collect the arm.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1770.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1770.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Insta-Gator trap activation&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Insta-Gator trap activation&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1770&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1771.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1771.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Floating zombie-arm pickup&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Floating zombie-arm pickup&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1771&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-infection-fingerprint" data-guide-step>Use the arm on the upstairs spawn fingerprint scanner. Take the red tablet from the opened safe and install it at the burger’s Access Denied screen. You are forced outside as explosives and the rocket launch.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1772.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1772.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Fingerprint scanner opening the red-tablet safe&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Fingerprint scanner opening the red-tablet safe&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1772&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-finish">Return the blue tablet</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-infection-blue-tablet" data-guide-step>After the launch, climb back inside the giant burger and collect the blue tablet underneath its screen. Give it to Bubby to finish. His armed patrol confirms the quest; after a round he explodes and leaves power-ups.<p class="guide-callout">The expelled bombs damage players too and explode if left lying. Clear space before returning to the hatch.</p><GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1773.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1773.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Blue tablet beneath the rooftop burger screen&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Blue tablet beneath the rooftop burger screen&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1773&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<h1 id="wiki_location_references">Location References</h1><section><h2 id="details-meat-locations">Meat-search atlas by district</h2><p class="guide-callout">Eight Atlas Command, ten Value Voltage, eight Sewers and ten Burger Town photographed candidates. Finding one piece satisfies its district; an empty candidate is not a collection.</p><ol><li id="guide-step-infection-atlas-0" data-guide-step>Search these possible Atlas Command locations. Collect the single piece found in this district, then deposit it before looking for another district’s piece.<ul><li>Roof of the Command Center</li><li>Behind the fence at the pillar just outside spawn</li><li>Garage door to the left of Exo Soldier</li><li>Beside the portable toilet</li><li>Right side of the power generator</li><li>Inside the Command Center</li><li>Far-right corner when leaving spawn</li><li>Container near Exo Slam</li></ul><GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1725.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1725.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Atlas Command: Roof of the Command Center&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Atlas Command: Roof of the Command Center&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1725&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1726.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1726.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Atlas Command: Behind the fence at the pillar just outside spawn&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Atlas Command: Behind the fence at the pillar just outside spawn&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1726&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1727.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1727.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Atlas Command: Garage door to the left of Exo Soldier&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Atlas Command: Garage door to the left of Exo Soldier&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1727&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1728.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1728.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Atlas Command: Beside the portable toilet&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Atlas Command: Beside the portable toilet&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1728&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1729.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1729.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Atlas Command: Right side of the power generator&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Atlas Command: Right side of the power generator&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1729&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1730.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1730.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Atlas Command: Inside t