<h1 id="wiki_side_quests">Side Quests</h1><section><h2 id="details-music">Toccata and Fugue in D minor music</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-infection-song" data-guide-step>Interact with the three golden rockets: Value Voltage’s shelf facing the upgrade station; the ground right of Atlas Command’s Exo Slam machine; and the Burger Town roof fence opening beside the large burger sign. The third starts the song.</li></ol></section><section><h2 id="guide-sources">Sources and review</h2><p>Source-reviewed on 8 October 2026, using the references below and the research handoff. These instructions and puzzle calculations have software checks; they have not been verified in a complete in-game playthrough. Record symbols, sequences and completion cues from your match. Screenshot and community-chart creators are credited with each illustration.</p><ul><li><a href="https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/infection/infection_guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">mmmrkennedy illustrated guide ↗</a></li>
